## What this does **not** cover

We do **not** own Pokémon, Pokémon Stadium 2, Game Boy sprites, music,
maps, or anything decoded from a ROM. Those belong to Nintendo /
The Pokémon Company / Game Freak / their licensors.

This package does not include ROMs, and it does not include any Stadium
model pack, extracted texture, voice, or music pulled from a ROM. Do
not redistribute any cache built from your imported ROM.

Third-party code we adapted stays under **its own** licenses. We cannot
re-copyright those files as “ours only”:

- Gen2Recomp(ed) engine — **UNDERdecoded (Ceedrack)** — see `CREDITS.md`
- DramaticShapes — MIT — `UPSTREAM_DRAMATIC_SHAPES_LICENSE.txt`
- StadiumBattleFX pieces — MIT — `UPSTREAM_STADIUM_BATTLE_FX_LICENSE.txt`
- Stadium 2 Importer (`lib/s2v/`) — see `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`
- Other credits — `CREDITS.md` and `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`

If this notice and an MIT file both apply to the same file, the MIT
file still applies to the **upstream** parts; our extra glue stays
under this family copyright.

